athenea-pieces f9c9a2b "A tube turns, a fold widens": its splat_relight half (kFoldTurnLow/High,
kFoldRoughness, foldWidened, SplatSlope.foldWiden, the sharp coat's and polish's
roughness widened by a fold). Its splat_project half (the turn split by t = 2
bakeSpread) is applied by the adapters (relight.slang, compact.slang), which
compute the slope themselves. kMaxFootprintTurn, which it replaces, was never
vendored.

--- a/splat/splat_relight.slang
